abstract: "This dataset contains data and code used in the manuscript \u201CDistribution\
  \ and drivers of parasite abundance in the hermit crab Pagurus hirsutiusculus\u201D\
  . Further details about the methodology is located in the manuscript and its supplementary\
  \ material. This data is meant to inform our understanding about what parasites\
  \ are present in the host Pagurus hirsutiusculus, as well as what factors control\
  \ their abundance. This study also investigates how parasite infection affects host\
  \ thermal response. Hermit crabs were surveyed for prevalence and occurrence at\
  \ a variety of sites from Calvert Island down to Southern Vancouver Island from\
  \ August 2020 - September 2021. Host relative abundance, salinity, and host size\
  \ were measured at the sites. DNA sequence data from three different parasites were\
  \ obtained from Calvert Island, Quadra Island, and Maple Bay during this sampling\
  \ period. Metabolic rate was measured at 5 temperatures (12\xB0C, 17\xB0C, 22\xB0\
  C, 27\xB0C, 32\xB0C) in Pagurus hirsutiusculus infected by Peltogaster sp. and uninfected\
  \ individuals in a laboratory at the University of British Columbia. Survival was\
  \ recorded at ambient seawater conditions (12\xB0C), and post temperature experiment.\
  \ Moulting was also recorded at ambient seawater conditions. Additionally, this\
  \ dataset contains occurrence and prevalence records of Peltogaster sp. found during\
  \ a review of the literature conducted in the summer of 2020."
